{"id":"illusion","lemma":"illusion","pos":"noun","rank":3033,"glosses":["illusion"],"ipa":"/i.ly.zjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/05/Fr-illusion.ogg/Fr-illusion.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"illusions"},"formAudio":{"illusions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-illusions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ne te fais pas d'illusions.","en":"Don't fool yourself.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1098066","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Arrêtez de vous faire des illusions.","en":"Stop deluding yourselves.","words":[{"g":"to stop","l":"arrêter"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"C'est une illusion d'optique.","en":"It's an optical illusion.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"optics"}]},{"text":"On s'est fait des illusions.","en":"We've been kidding ourselves.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Nous nous berçons d'illusions.","en":"We're deluding ourselves.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"we / us"},null,{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}